  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Adopcin de Tecnologas Climticamente Inteligentes en MIPYMES Agrcolas Lideradas por Mujeres</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Adoption of Climate-Smart Technologies in Agricultural MSMEs Lead by Women</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo es contribuir al aumento de resiliencia de micro, pequeas y medianas empresas (MIPYMES) agrcolas lideradas por mujeres mediante apoyo para la adopcin de tecnologas climticamente inteligentes y asistencia tcnica para su implementacin.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective is to contribute to the resilience of women micro, small and medium enterprises (MSMEs) led by women through support for the adoption of climate-smart technologies and technical assistance for their implementation.</narrative>
  </description>
